WEBVTT

00:17:29.546 --> 00:17:31.633
as an exclamation point

00:17:31.633 --> 00:17:33.426
to the miraculous month

00:17:33.426 --> 00:17:37.104
of August 2014:

00:17:37.104 --> 00:17:43.248
That girlfriend that he went to get on 
the night of diagnosis is now his wife,

00:17:43.248 --> 00:17:51.625
and Pete and Julie have given me my 
granddaughter, Lucy Fitzgerald Frates.

00:17:51.625 --> 00:17:56.730
Lucy Fitzgerald Frates came two weeks early

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.928
as the exclamation point

00:17:58.928 --> 00:18:03.307
on August 31st, 2014.